00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.710
The fact is that I have to cut the beast down.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:01.250
To do this I must know your story!

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:02.220
Tell me!

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:12.830
You are the creator of the beast.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:15.990
You have an obligation to talk!

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.330
