00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.220
If the girl…

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:28.700
If Tamaki…

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.600
Please don’t take her! Have mercy!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:33.560
