00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:01.940
She hardly put up a fight.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.530
It was as though…

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.120
…and leaned in

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.540
