00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:33.140
Even if I had sent her home,
it would not have gone well for her.

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:40.270
So I dressed her in lavish kimonos

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:43.500
and fed her the finest foods.

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:47.370
It was the least I could do.

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:56.580
I had believed that our
days would go on forever.

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:06.020
I took her in the prime of her life.

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:09.460
I can only imagine her regret and remorse.

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:14.170
So you’re suggesting that the girl’s grudge

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:16.330
possessed the cat

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:18.730
and became the Ghost Cat?

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.780
Incredible…

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.700
Elder master…

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:26.880
It’s likely that

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:33.750
her spirit couldn’t bear to see
a bride leaving this household.

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:36.650
And, of course,

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:42.480
a woman’s grudge is incorrigible indeed.

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:46.320
You say it like it doesn’t
concern you! You bastard!

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:49.260
Bastard?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:54.840
I only did what I was told!

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:57.080
I did nothing wrong!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.600
Nothing wrong at all!

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:04.650
Everybody was using me
for their own convenience!

00:07:07.950 --> 00:07:10.690
You figured I’d do anything I was told!

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:14.020
You abused your authority!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.700
That’s so cruel!

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:22.000
Cruel! Cruel! Cruel!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:25.240
Cruel! Cruel! Cruel!

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.790
Master Odajima!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:26.790
Yes!

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.210
What is it?!

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:29.330
What’s missing?!

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:34.710
Elder master!

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:35.260
Ms. Sato!

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:35.260
Is it the Truth?

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:36.950
Ms. Sato!

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.760
Ms. Sato!

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.760
You’re making a fool of me!

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.600
Ms. Sato!

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:40.600
They’re all making a fool of me…

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.520
Let’s go!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:42.520
Making a fool of me…!

00:07:46.350 --> 00:07:48.290
Master Sasaoka, open the door!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:49.460
Please open the door!

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:50.440
Master Yoshikuni!

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.560
Master Yoshikuni!

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:52.700
Yoshikuni!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.660
Yoshikuni!

00:07:55.570 --> 00:07:57.760
Yoshikuni! Yoshikuni!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:04.040
You’re always mocking me with those eyes!

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:08.750
You’re going to hell, that’s for sure!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.790
Yoshikuni!

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.090
Kayo! I’m coming…!

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.880
You…!

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.800
You are going to protect me.

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.620
The Regret of humans

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.440
and the Regret of Mononoke

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.280
are entirely different.

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:37.780
I beg you!

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:38.490
I beg you!

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:40.280
Please! I beg you!

00:08:40.280 --> 00:08:40.950
I beg you!

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:42.990
Please!

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.670
Please! Do something!

00:08:58.460 --> 00:09:00.450
If Odajima

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.990
is asking for my help,

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.330
I have no choice.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:15.410
With the Truth and Regret…

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:21.610
This sword…

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:25.350
shall be released!

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:28.210
What?!

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:53.850
Is this…

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.720
Something you are showing me?

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:21.180
This is how it should be!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.610
You should all die!

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:34.430
There, there…

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:35.590
There, there…

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:38.660
Kitty, kitty… Good boy…

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:40.220
Good boy.

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:57.040
No!

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.840
Help me!

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.750
This is

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:14.160
the past.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:22.730
Please show us the story to the end.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:48.330
I come here after a long absence and I see that

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.030
they have

00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:51.530
made themselves

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.000
