00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:06.940
If you’re not going to eat,
I won’t bring you any more.

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:10.760
Keeping you alive isn’t free.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.190
Kitty?

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.170
Oh, right.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.590
Well, well. So you suddenly decided to eat.

00:13:53.590 --> 00:13:55.820
You certainly are disgusting.

00:13:58.800 --> 00:14:00.290
Eat some more.

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:09.140
Kitty… Kitty…

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.370
There, there… Eat all you want.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:21.690
There, there… Good boy.

00:14:21.690 --> 00:14:23.750
Good boy.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.080
Don’t make

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:29.950
any noise.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:37.540
Father’s been wondering
what to do with you lately.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:40.340
Poor girl.

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:42.110
Kitty, kitty. Good boy.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.810
You may be…

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.100
You stay there…

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.100
…dead soon.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:01.520
Yoshikuni!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:03.790
Father!

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:08.170
When did you do this?

00:15:08.170 --> 00:15:12.300
A lowly, country girl seducing my son!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.440
It sickens me!

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:16.040
It’s inexcusable! Inexcusable!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:17.580
Inexcusable! Inexcusable!

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.440
Inexcusable!

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:29.020
What are you trying to do?!

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:31.690
You lowly beast!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.860
Run to the outside world.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.290
Hold it!

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:38.290
Kitty, kitty, run…

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:41.730
My sweet, sweet

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.170
kitty, kitty.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.700
You must live on your own.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.420
Farewell…

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:08.650
Allow me, Sasaoka, to take care of the rest.

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:17.600
Ghost Cat…

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:21.510
Your Truth and Regret

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:25.160
I have taken to heart.

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.380
With your Truth

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:35.980
and your Regret

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:41.680
I release the sword!

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.330
Release!

00:17:29.840 --> 00:17:32.980
I understand what you’re
capable of as I’ve seen you in action.

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:35.110
It will not work against me.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.150
You are not destined to
belong in this dimension.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:38.990
I will exorcise you!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.040
Forgive me!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.150
Vanish!

